{"id":"n16732-1-5","stage":2,"title":"쓸데없이 · 白白地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16732-1-5-1","ko":"요즘 돈이 항상 모자라.","zh":"最近钱总是不够用。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이","audio":"/audio/6fc43b50168ec9dd1ba6.mp3"}},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常。","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}},{"text":"모자라.","meaning":"不够，不足","explanation":"모자라다：不够，不足；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모자라다","audio":"/audio/05ceb5dfc162d026352d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46143","senseId":"1","lemma":"모자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모자라","audio":"/audio/5e4a151c1ca2acc6dd6e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"购物或做某事时所需的钱财。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"05ceb5dfc162d026","term":"모자라다","zh":"不够，不足","audio":"/audio/05ceb5dfc162d026352d.mp3","entryId":"46143","definition":"达不到规定的数量或程度。","pronunciation":["모ː자라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3ae34dfd92a72a6e423.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16732-1-5-2","ko":"쓸데없이 돈을 많이 쓰니까 그렇지.","zh":"就是因为你乱花钱太多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"쓸데없이","meaning":"白白地","explanation":"쓸데없이：白白地。","readings":[{"term":"쓸데없이","audio":"/audio/bd70dda7cb69022e07a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16732","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓸데없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓸데없이","audio":"/audio/bd70dda7cb69022e07a8.mp3"}},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈을","audio":"/audio/658b47180707ddf8eb38.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰니까","meaning":"花，费，花费","explanation":"쓰다：花，费，花费；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"5","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰니까","audio":"/audio/0c45d14a910b430aebca.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇지.","meaning":"那样，一般","explanation":"그렇다：那样，一般；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"5","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bd70dda7cb69022e","term":"쓸데없이","zh":"白白地","audio":"